        <activityName xml:lang="en">Precast concrete, reinforced, CEM II/A, with resource correction, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Precast concrete, reinforced, CEM II/A, with resource correction, at plant
Modern European and Swiss technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 5c665eac-fe15-44ed-98de-448fafb333c6
Production of 1 m³ precast concrete, reinforced, CEM II/A, with resource correction, at plant in Switzerland. Includes waste treatment from production. End-of-life treatment of the concrete product is excluded and must be modeled in downstream processe
Location: Europe
Technology: Production of precast concrete, reinforced, CEM II/A, with resource correction, at plant, using industrial machinery.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c665eac-fe15-44ed-98de-448fafb333c6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
